{"unit_id": "RaulLazaro__dsh-preview-plugin#feature-multi-port", "repo": "RaulLazaro/dsh-preview-plugin", "commit": "66424990172a8062a1ecf3cbc113a89e0a01a730", "type": "feature", "lang": "zh", "text": "dsh-preview-plugin 的功能「多端口预览」：用户或 agent 可设置前端端口及多个后端端口，插件通过同一预览页面转发相应请求，适用于前后端分开的项目。", "source": "generated", "evidence": ["lib/index.js:764-819", "lib/index.js:896-980"]}
